  "purpose": "(Clinical Focus: Represents the result or status of a sensory or speech assessment, indicating functional performance.),(Data Element Scope: Used to record the outcome of a sensory or speech evaluation, such as level of impairment or functionality (e.g., intact, decreased).),(Inclusion Criteria: Includes coded responses defined for sensory status assessments, includes SNOMED CT qualifiers representing performance or impairment levels.),(Exclusion Criteria: Does not include diagnosis codes, unrelated clinical findings, or non-standard answers not aligned with sensory assessment context.)",
